	<section_number>20-48</section_number>
	<catch_line>Minimum age of marriage</catch_line>
	<text>
		The minimum age at which persons may marry shall be 18.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 5090; 1932, p. 529; 1942, p. 230; 1946, p. 500; 1960, c. 363; 1972, c. 823; 1974, cc. 44, 45; 1975, c. 644; 1989, c. 733; 2008, cc. 174, 206; 2016, cc. 457, 543; 2024, c. 737.</history>
